      "ASTM B366 / SB366 Hastelloy C22 Pipe Cap Supplier, ASME B16.9 Hastelloy Alloy C276 End Pipe Cap, Alloy UNS N06022 Pipe End Cap, UNS N10276 Buttweld Cap, DIN 2.4602 / 2.4819 End Cap",
      "ASTM B366 / SB366 Hastelloy C22 Equal Cross, ASME B16.9 Hastelloy Alloy C276 Buttweld Cross, Alloy UNS N06022 / N10276 Unequal Cross, DIN 2.4602 / 2.4819 Reducing Cross",
