      "Monel 400/K500 Buttweld Fittings are used by several applications of industries and in different engineering sectors. The industries in which these buttweld fittings are used such as power generation, gas processing, seawater equipment, heat exchangers, chemical equipment, pulp and paper industry, pharmaceutical equipment, oil-shore oil drilling industry, and many more.",
