      "Alloy 20 Flanges are suitable for the use in many of the general works and industries like pharmaceutical equipment, offshore oil drilling industry, condensers, paper industry, specialty chemical industry, gas processing, petrochemical industry, power generation industry, heat exchanger, food processing, seawater equipment, aerospace industry, chemical industry, and chemical equipment.",
      "Alloy 20 Flanges have the impeccable design and high strength for the use in the harsh environments without any deformation to the alloy flanges. These flanges are made with the essential properties for high ductility, durability, flexibility, and formability as well. These flanges are resistive from the entire type of general corrosions and rusts. These alloy flanges are made with the heating and perception process so that it can be easily used chemical processing and for storage purposes.",
