      "UNS S31635 Long Weld Neck Flanges, Stainless Steel 1.4571 Long Weld Neck Flanges, ASTM A182 F304L Stainless Steel Long Weld Neck Flanges, ASME SA 182 SS 316Ti Long Weld Neck Flanges",
      "UNS S31603 Spectacle Blind Flanges, ANSI / ASME B16.5 Stainless Steel 316 Spectacle Blind Flanges, ASTM A182 F304L Stainless Steel Spectacle Blind Flanges, SA 182 SS 316Ti Spectacle Blind Flanges",
