      "Specification of Stainless Steel 316/316L/316Ti Flanges",
      "Stainless Steel Flanges Specification : ASTM A182 / ASME SA182 Dimension Standard : ANSI/ASME B16.5, B 16.47 Series A & B, B16.48, BS4504, BS 10, EN-1092, DIN, etc. Standard : ANSI Flanges, ASME Flanges, BS Flanges, DIN Flanges, EN Flanges, etc. Size : 1/2\" (15 NB) to 48\" (1200NB) Class / Pressure : 150#, 300#, 600#, 900#, 1500#, 2500#, PN6, PN10, PN16, PN25, PN40, PN64 etc. Flange Face Type : Flate Face (FF), Raised Face (RF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ) DIN Flanges : DIN 2527, 2566, 2573, 2576, 2641,2642, 2655, 2656, 2627, 2628, 2629, 2631, 2632, 2633, 2634, 2635, 2636, 2637,2638, 2673. JIS Flanges : JIS B2220 5K, JIS B2220 10K, JIS B2220 16K, JIS B2220 20K BS Flanges : BS4504 PN 6, BS 4504 PN 10, BS4504 PN 16, BS4504 PN 25, BS4504 PN 40, BS 4504 PN 64, BS 4504 PN 100, BS 4504 PN 160, BS 4504 PN 250, BS 10, BS Table D, BS Table E, BS Table F, BS Table H.",
