      "Vedantara Metal & Alloys & Engg. Co has emerged to attain a vast market position as the suppliers of ferrous and non-ferrous metals in the industrial market. We manufacture and produce Incoloy 800/800HT/825 Pipes & Tubes according to the needs and demands of the customers.",
      "Incoloy also known as high-performance alloys are the super alloys which provide high resistance to corrosion and oxidation. At elevated temperatures it provides mechanical strength. Incoloy 800/800HT/825 Pipes &Tubes can be offered in welded, seamless or welded and cold form depending on the alloy the customer requires. Incoloy super alloys are widely used by industrial furnaces, nuclear engineering pressure vessels, and heaters in power plants. These are also used in chemical processing, pulp and paper, and heat exchangers.",
      "Incoloy 800/800HT/825 Pipes & Tubes are used in the nuclear power plant and paper pulp industry. These tubes are often used in reforming furnaces of steam methane and also in extruded tubing. They are manufactured both seamless as well as welded forms. These pipes are extremely resistant to corrosion, even if it is in an acidic environment. It is used in a wide range by many industries throughout the world for a number of applications, especially for those which deal with temperatures about 600 Degree C.",
      "It can be used in any type of environment without costing any damage. These are mainly required in pulp and paper industries, gas, oil, and petrochemicals. Nickel, chromium, and manganese are used to manufacture Incoloy 800/800HT/825 Pipes & Tubes which helps to strengthen the product and which also provides toughness to the product.",
      "Incoloy 800/800HT/825 Pipes & Tubes comes in different shapes and sizes. These are of the great demand for those who produce the soaring grades of material. These tubes are very resilient to erosion as well as in the acidic environments. Its end is also of three type's plain end, beveled end and treaded.",
