      "Today Alloy 20 Sheets & Plates are extensively used in many industrial applications. It is like heat exchangers, condensers, pulp & paper industry, petrochemicals, pharmaceuticals, specialty chemicals, chemical industry, oil & gas processing, seawater applications, automobiles, building, and constructions.",
      "Alloy 20 Sheets & Plates are thoroughly quality tested before dispatched from our industry. The tests are majorly done for checking the product strength. The tests are pitting corrosion tests, toughness tests, positive material identification tests, etc. The packaging of the same is done in wooden pallets for safer shipping.",
