      "This grade works well with malleable and strong performances. This impeccably finished grade is composed of the chemical components like silicon, iron, copper, magnesium, manganese, chromium, zinc, titanium, and aluminium. Hence, this chemical make-up has a melting point range going from 607 to 649 degrees Celsius.",
