      "Hastelloy C22/C276 Sheets & Plates are constructed by our company following international and national standards. They are used widely in various applications and industries including chemical industry, Industries using fats, Fertilizer industry, cement industries, shipbuilders, Sugar mills and distilleries, Paper industries, Designing plants, steel plants, solid plant contraption, mechanical and general building purposes.",
