      "There are many types of SS 317L Sheets & Plates that we offer to our esteem patrons. Some of them are Hot Rolled Plate, Chequered Plates, Steel Cold Rolled Plate, Stainless Steel Shim Plate, Perforated Plate, Designer Plate, Plain Plates, Circular plates, and many more.",
      "The SS 317L Sheets & Plates are used in various industrial applications all around the world. These stainless steel 317/317L plates are often used in Textile equipment, Food Processing Equipment, Condensers in fossil fuel, nuclear-fueled power generations, etc. These plates are also used in Chemical processing equipment, pulp and paper manufacturing, petrochemicals equipment, and so on.",
