      "They are more often seen in the constructional as well as architectural works. For the reason that it is easily available and cost-effective in nature; it is being used in manufacturing kitchenettes like BBQ grills. They are also highly demanded in making the vessels, tanks, and storage containers in the chemical processing industries. As they consist of great stress as well as pressure tolerance attributes. Moreover, they have been utilized by the textile equipment, paper, and pulp equipment, food processing equipment industries, etc.",
      "SS 316/316L/316Ti Sheets & Plates also present forth for the tests like PMI test, flaring test, flattening test, IGC test, etc. Other than this they provide documentations like heat treatment chart, material traceability certificates, QAP, raw material certificates, fumigation tests, etc.",
