      "Copper Nickel 70/30 is the alloy that is based on elements like chromium, nickel, and molybdenum. This is the reason that the alloy is used in the industrial application used in the elevated temperatures. However, the alloy is the best among all the others alloys which are used in the application. The alloy is having the best corrosion resistance properties similar to the copper nickel 90/10. Along with this, the alloy is also having the high yielding strength which is there in the austenitic grade of alloy.",
      "Copper Nickel 70/30 Round Bars/Rods is used in industries such as petrochemical, pharmaceuticals, oil and gas, pulp and paper, and many more. The rods and bars are used in the industries because of the properties that are inherited in them. The properties which are there in the bars and rods are corrosion resistance ability, pitting corrosion resistance, crevice corrosion resistance in the elevated temperature.",
      "Along with this, there are many other properties such as great ductility, durability, great tensile strength, toughness, and stability in the elevated temperatures. This is the reason that they are used in industrial applications.",
      "Before the delivery to the clients, Copper Nickel 70/30 Round Bars/Rods are going through many tests. Some of the tests by which the bars and rods are moving are hardness, hydrostatic, ultrasonic, micro, macro, and positive material identification. This is done to ensure the clients that they are provided with the best quality of the bars and rods.",
