      "Monel ASTM B164 400 Rectangular Bar, UNS N04400 / DIN 2.4360 Rectangular Bar, ASME SB164 Monel Alloy K500 Rectangular Rod, Monel Alloy 400 Rectangle Rod, Alloy 400 Rectangle Bar, Polish Monel Alloy K500 Rectangular Bar Supplier",
      "DIN 2.4375 Flat Bar, UNS N04400 Flat Bar, ASME SB 164 Monel 400 Flat Bar, ASTM B164 K500 Monel Alloy Flat Rod, Monel® Alloy 400/K500 Polish Flat Bar",
      "ASTM B164 K500 Monel Bright Bar, Monel Alloy UNS N04400/ N05500 Bright Bar, Alloy 400 Bright Rod, Monel Alloy 400/K500 Polish Bright Bar",
      "UNS N04400 Forged Bar, Monel 400 Forged Rod, ASTM B164 400 Monel Polish Forged Bar, ASME SB164 Monel Alloy K500 Forged Bar",
      "Monel Round Bar Specification : ASTM B164 / A479, ASME SB164 / A479 Dimension Standard : EN, DIN, JIS, ASTM, BS, ASME, AISI Size : 14mm-300mm Thickness : 50 mm to 6000 mm Long Length : 1 To 6 Meters, Custom Cut Length Form : Round, Square, Hex(A/F), Rectangle, Billet, Ingot, Forging Etc.",
      "Monel Alloy 400/K500 Round Bar Application Industries",
