      "316LVM Round Bar also called as WNR 1.4441 and UNS S31673 bars are containing nickel to 13-15% that is used commonly for different purposes. It is like cardiac stents, guide wires, blood lancets, surgical tools & instruments, suture wire, bone pins, small machined parts, high precision electronics, skin closure staples, and body jewelry. It also is used for forming the washers, springs, cables and careens.",
      "316LVM Round Bar is available in various specifications. It is including ASRM A276, ASTM A473, ASTM A484, ASTM A582 and ASTM A479.",
