      "They have great flexibility, weldability, durability, and pocket- friendly. It has a maximum elongation range to 20%. Plus they have the highest melting point range at the 1665 degrees Celsius (or 3030 degrees Fahrenheit). They come in temper ranges like H8, H9, H10, H11, H12, h13 K9, K10, K11, and k12 (or as per the client's requirements).",
